[03/22 13:33:39     11s] @@file 13: set_db design_process_node $iv::node
[03/22 13:33:39     11s] ##  Process: 65            (User Set)               
[03/22 13:33:39     11s] ##     Node: (not set)                           
[03/22 13:33:39     11s] 
