[03/22 13:35:38    126s] @file 41: ### Runs routing or postroute via or wire optimization using the NanoRoute router.
[03/22 13:35:38    126s] @file 42: ### -globalDetail : Runs timing-driven and SI-driven global and detailed routing.
[03/22 13:35:38    126s] @file 43: ### When specified, it unfixes the clock nets and then routes all nets, including clocks that still need to be routed.
[03/22 13:35:38    126s] @file 44: ### It does not ECO route the clock nets prior to other signals so clock nets are not given priority as they are with routeDesign.
