[03/22 13:40:35    380s] #@ Begin verbose source ../scripts/7_export.tcl (pre)
[03/22 13:40:35    380s] @file 1: # Rui ("Ray") Xu
[03/22 13:40:35    380s] @file 2: # Nov 2021
[03/22 13:40:35    380s] @file 3: # CISL @ Columbia, Kinget Group
